
# Student Management ER Diagram

```mermaid
erDiagram
    STUDENTS ||--o{ ENROLLMENTS : registers
    COURSES ||--o{ ENROLLMENTS : includes

    STUDENTS {
        int student_id PK
        string first_name
        string last_name
        string email
    }

    COURSES {
        int course_id PK
        string course_name
        string course_code
        int credits
    }

    ENROLLMENTS {
        int enrollment_id PK
        int student_id FK
        int course_id FK
        date enrollment_date
        string grade
    }
```
